# Netlify proxy for the Penlight API.
#
# The API is public and unauthenticated for reads but sends no
# Access-Control-Allow-Origin header, so the browser will not let this site
# call it cross-origin. Proxying through the same origin sidesteps that
# without asking Harry to change anything on his side.
#
# Keep this in sync with dev.py, which does the same thing locally.

/api/*  https://penlight.wardwise.org/api/:splat  200
